Maintainer: John-Michael Mulesa <jmulesa@gmail.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), curl, ca-certificates, unzip
Standards-Version: 4.7.0
Homepage: https://re-volt.io/downloads/game
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: revolt-data-revoltio
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: rvgl-bin
Provides: revolt-data
Conflicts: revolt-data, revolt-data-steam
Description: Re-Volt game data for RVGL from Re-Volt I/O
 The original Re-Volt (1999) game files (tracks, cars, graphics and sounds),
 downloaded at build time from Re-Volt I/O, the community site that hosts them
 for RVGL Launcher, and installed as RVGL's game_files pack in
 /opt/rvgl/packs/game_files. Play it with rvgl-bin.
